{% comment %}
  购物车补充建议（pages-ui §10 · task-cart T-1.5 · SDD §6.3）。

  两条路径（刘工 2026-11-02 定 D-4）：
    A 服务端先渲染商家指定的集合——**这条必须永远能出结果**，它是无 JS 与
      "未配置 complementary" 时的全部内容。
    B 有 JS 且有车内商品时，向 /recommendations/products 要"与该商品互补"的推荐，
      拿到就替换 A。拿不到（空 / 失败 / 未配置 Search & Discovery）→ 保持 A，不闪烁。

  选品取向：默认指向**配件集合**。参考图那种"再卖一台割草机"与本主题
  「主机 + 耗材」的客单价结构相悖——买完割草机的人下一次要的是刀片，不是第二台割草机。

  排除逻辑：已在车内的商品不再推荐（服务端与 JS 替换后都生效，因为推荐接口
  渲染同一个 section 时 `cart` 依然可用）。
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign rec_collection = section.settings.collection
  assign rec_limit = section.settings.products_to_show | default: 4
  assign rec_heading = section.settings.heading
  if rec_heading == blank
    assign rec_heading = 'cart.recommendations' | t
  endif
  assign rec_pool = rec_limit | plus: cart.item_count
  if rec_pool > 12
    assign rec_pool = 12
  endif

  assign rec_cart_ids = cart.items | map: 'product_id'

  comment
    种子商品优先取车内第一台"主机"（有 acc.consumables 的），
    配件在 complementary 关系里通常是叶子节点，拿它当种子基本要不到东西。
  endcomment
  assign rec_seed_id = ''
  for rec_seed_item in cart.items
    if rec_seed_item.product.metafields.acc.consumables.value != blank
      assign rec_seed_id = rec_seed_item.product.id
      break
    endif
  endfor
  if rec_seed_id == '' and cart.item_count > 0
    assign rec_seed_id = cart.items.first.product.id
  endif
-%}

{%- if rec_collection != blank and rec_collection.products_count > 0 -%}
  {%- comment -%} product-card 的三个依赖：样式 + 收藏 + 快速加购 + 倾斜 {%- endcomment -%}
  {{ 'product-card.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  <script src="{{ 'wishlist-toggle.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
  <script src="{{ 'quick-add.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
  <script src="{{ 'tilt-element.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

  <div
    class="cart-recommendations"
    data-cart-recommendations
    data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"
    data-seed-product-id="{{ rec_seed_id }}"
    data-limit="{{ rec_limit }}"
    data-root="{{ routes.root_url }}"
    {%- unless section.settings.enable_personalized %} data-personalized="false"{% endunless %}
  >
    <h2 class="cart-recommendations__heading">{{ rec_heading | escape }}</h2>

    <ul class="cart-recommendations__grid" role="list" data-cart-recommendations-grid>
      {%- assign rec_output_count = 0 -%}
      {%- for rec_product in rec_collection.products limit: rec_pool -%}
        {%- if rec_cart_ids contains rec_product.id -%}
          {%- continue -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if rec_output_count >= rec_limit -%}
          {%- break -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        <li class="cart-recommendations__item" data-recommendation-id="{{ rec_product.id }}">
          {%- render 'product-card',
            product: rec_product,
            lazy: true,
            quick_add: true,
            show_width: false,
            show_cc: false,
            show_power: true,
            show_weight: false,
            sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 22vw, (min-width: 750px) 32vw, 72vw'
          -%}
        </li>
        {%- assign rec_output_count = rec_output_count | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </div>

  <script src="{{ 'cart-recommendations.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .cart-recommendations {
    padding-block-start: 0.5rem;
  }
  .cart-recommendations__heading {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-block-end: 0.85rem;
  }
  .cart-recommendations__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .cart-recommendations__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  /* 窄屏横滑：露出 1.2 张卡暗示还能滑，避免"只看到两张"的误解 */
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .cart-recommendations__grid {
      grid-template-columns: none;
      grid-auto-flow: column;
      grid-auto-columns: 72%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      padding-block-end: 0.5rem;
      scrollbar-width: thin;
    }
    .cart-recommendations__item {
      scroll-snap-align: start;
    }
  }

  /* 个性化结果替换的过渡：不做淡入淡出会闪一下（图片重新加载） */
  .cart-recommendations[data-personalizing] .cart-recommendations__grid {
    opacity: 0.35;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.cart_recommendations.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "cart-recommendations-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "t:labels.heading",
      "default": "t:sections.cart_recommendations.defaults.heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "t:labels.collection",
      "info": "t:sections.cart_recommendations.labels.collection_info"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "products_to_show",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 8,
      "step": 2,
      "label": "t:labels.products_to_show",
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "enable_personalized",
      "label": "t:sections.cart_recommendations.labels.enable_personalized",
      "info": "t:sections.cart_recommendations.labels.enable_personalized_info",
      "default": true
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:sections.cart_recommendations.name"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
